# OWEN public repo — AI rules

This is the **public** OWEN extension mirror (`caalh/owen`). Extension **source code** is open
(MIT). **AI maintainer documentation does not belong here.**

## Where AI docs live (private monorepo only)

| Doc | Location |
|-----|----------|
| `AGENTS.md` | `BelvoirDynamics/owen/` |
| `AI_MAINTAINER_GUIDE.md` | `BelvoirDynamics/owen/` |
| `AI_CHANGELOG.md` | `BelvoirDynamics/owen/` (+ division-wide log at monorepo root) |
| `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` | `BelvoirDynamics/owen/` |
| Cursor rules for sync | `BelvoirDynamics/.cursor/rules/owen-public-sync.mdc` |

Before non-trivial OWEN work, read those files in the **BelvoirDynamics** monorepo, not here.

## What to update in this repo

- **User-facing release notes:** `CHANGELOG.md` only (Keep a Changelog).
- **Do not recreate** `AGENTS.md`, `AI_CHANGELOG.md`, `AI_MAINTAINER_GUIDE.md`, or
  `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` — they are gitignored on purpose.

## Sync with the monorepo

OWEN exists in two places:

| Copy | Repo | Gets |
|------|------|------|
| `BelvoirDynamics/owen/` | private monorepo | all changes (code + AI docs) |
| this repo | `caalh/owen` | **extension code only** |

Mirror **source, tests, syntaxes, snippets, docs/LSP_DESIGN.md, CHANGELOG.md, README.md** to
both copies before release. Mirror AI hygiene docs **only** in the monorepo.

## Release reminder

After shipping from here: bump version strings on reactormc.net — see
`reactor-monte-carlo-guide/.cursor/rules/owen-version.mdc`.
